 "about": "Circuit's face map. OUAK's code shows a face by turning 23 objects on and off (its face component, MainGameOujiFace), one face group per motion row. Circuit's new style has a piece for each of the 23 slots, named as the slot, plus their humming eyes. Their old style shows one of 11 cards: their four, and one for each of Forever's face expressions, numbered as Burda's are. The OUAK slots and groups below are the same as in Burda's map; the Forever expressions and the motion rows' cards are not repeated here and are read from Burda's map by card number (see 'shared'). All mappings are mine; nobody has seen them in the game.",
